                "text": "Buying a home, especially nowadays, can be a confusing, expensive process. So, I've introduced bipartisan legislation that would both help teach new homebuyers the skills they need and give them a leg up on their FHA mortgage insurance premiums.\nhttps://t.co/nSZV9wgnyz",
