                "text": "Over 2.5 MILLION Michiganders \u2014 including children and seniors \u2014 rely on Medicaid to receive quality, affordable health care.\n\nPresident Trump wants to slash Medicaid to pay for tax cuts for billionaires. I'll keep fighting back.",
