                "retweet_count": 22,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "More than 2.5 MILLION Michiganders receive quality, affordable health care thanks to Medicaid. But President Trump wants to slash life-changing care for seniors, children, and working families \u2014 all to pay for tax cuts for his billionaire buddies.  \n\nI\u2019ll keep fighting back.",
