                "text": "Medicaid covers more than 2.5 million Michiganders. But President Trump wants to gut it and kick children, seniors, and people with disabilities off their health care \u2014 all to give a massive tax break to billionaires. I'm going to fight it every step of the way. https://t.co/YzY3M4FTDU",
